# kenspeckle docs

_kenspeckle_ (Scots): easily recognized, familiar at sight. Svelte 5 utilities under one naming convention — no `use` prefix, no forced classes, attachments as a first-class layer.

See the [roadmap](/docs/roadmap) for what's shipped and what's coming.

## Utilities

### Classes

- [FiniteStateMachine](/docs/finite-state-machine) — fully typed FSM with reactive context

### Attachments

- [copy](/docs/copy) — clipboard attachment + imperative helper
- [viewTransitionName](/docs/view-transition-name) — name an element for the transition it takes part in

### Functions

- [viewTransition](/docs/view-transition) — view transitions, with a SvelteKit navigation tier
